# Tests

This project has two test groups:

- `test/native/`: host-side Unity tests for configuration, channel allocation,
  timeout handling, prepend buffers, circuit-breaker logic, and related helpers.
- `test/integration/`: hardware-in-the-loop tests that drive a real ESP32
  through reverse SSH tunnels using the supplied Docker test stack.

For the hardware test setup and commands, see
[`test/integration/README.md`](integration/README.md).

The reference ESP32-C3 firmware must still be validated on real hardware after
memory-sensitive, transport, reconnect, or provisioning changes. A successful
compile alone is not considered runtime validation.
